<title>HONG KONG: NatWest sets call warrants on CITIC.</title>
<headline>NatWest sets call warrants on CITIC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Financial Products plc said on Thursday it has issued 71 million American-style call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$37.905	PREMIUM	    14.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.79002     GEARING	    5.05X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 06.MAR.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  25.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     26.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE  HK$39.90	 MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
